{
 "recap": {
  "file": "recap.mp3",
  "hash": "92c2b3c07f5fffa1",
  "text": "台湾から家族六人でにほんへ来ました。にほんごができるのは、おかあさんのかけいだけです。",
  "voice": "Schedar",
  "model": "gemini-3.8-flash-lite-tts"
 },
 "s1-01": {
  "file": "s1-01.mp3",
  "hash": "d26cfc3b58ffeb7d",
  "text": "次のかた、どうぞ。",
  "voice": "Alnilam",
  "model": "gemini-3.8-flash-lite-tts"
 },
 "s1-02": {
  "file": "s1-02.mp3",
  "hash": "528f71411c44f3cc",
  "text": "ご家族ですか。",
  "voice": "Alnilam",
  "model": "gemini-3.8-flash-lite-tts"
 },
 "s1-03": {
  "file": "s1-03.mp3",
  "hash": "9789508a82fd2a32",
  "text": "はい、家族です。六人です。",
  "voice": "Autonoe",
  "model": "gemini-3.8-flash-lite-tts"
 },
 "s1-04": {
  "file": "s1-04.mp3",
  "hash": "4541737f1803cfb4",
  "text": "では、皆さんのパスポートを見せてください。",
  "voice": "Alnilam",
  "model": "gemini-3.8-flash-lite-tts"
 },
 "s1-05": {
  "file": "s1-05.mp3",
  "hash": "635c6cf323d125b5",
  "text": "お子様のパスポートもお願いします。",
  "voice": "Alnilam",
  "model": "gemini-3.8-flash-lite-tts"
 },
 "s1-06": {
  "file": "s1-06.mp3",
  "hash": "0c080ce8958bb42d",
  "text": "はい、これです。娘と息子のです。",
  "voice": "Autonoe",
  "model": "gemini-3.8-flash-lite-tts"
 },
 "s1-07": {
  "file": "s1-07.mp3",
  "hash": "05386cd277c79605",
  "text": "この写真は、お嬢さんですか。",
  "voice": "Alnilam",
  "model": "gemini-3.8-flash-lite-tts"
 },
 "s1-08": {
  "file": "s1-08.mp3",
  "hash": "eeb442392436595f",
  "text": "いいえ、それは息子です。赤ちゃんの時の写真です。",
  "voice": "Autonoe",
  "model": "gemini-3.8-flash-lite-tts"
 },
 "s1-09": {
  "file": "s1-09.mp3",
  "hash": "d283051f6c88337a",
  "text": "あ、そうですか。では、大人のかただけ、ここに指を置いてください。",
  "voice": "Alnilam",
  "model": "gemini-3.8-flash-lite-tts"
 },
 "s1-11": {
  "file": "s1-11.mp3",
  "hash": "aaee07671be2c585",
  "text": "はい、おとうさまもお願いします。",
  "voice": "Alnilam",
  "model": "gemini-3.8-flash-lite-tts"
 },
 "s1-10": {
  "file": "s1-10.mp3",
  "hash": "a5dec9ed440f1dae",
  "text": "父もですか。",
  "voice": "Autonoe",
  "model": "gemini-3.8-flash-lite-tts"
 },
 "s1-12": {
  "file": "s1-12.mp3",
  "hash": "1e2b138b3caf65dc",
  "text": "こちらのかたは、ご主人ですか。",
  "voice": "Alnilam",
  "model": "gemini-3.8-flash-lite-tts"
 },
 "s1-13": {
  "file": "s1-13.mp3",
  "hash": "d94890562cfb9c5b",
  "text": "ハイ！ゴシュジン、デス！",
  "voice": "Enceladus",
  "model": "gemini-3.8-flash-lite-tts"
 },
 "s1-14": {
  "file": "s1-14.mp3",
  "hash": "78ac0dd4ad897798",
  "text": "はい、けっこうです。ようこそにほんへ。",
  "voice": "Alnilam",
  "model": "gemini-3.8-flash-lite-tts"
 },
 "s2-01": {
  "file": "s2-01.mp3",
  "hash": "6db3e29976b46945",
  "text": "すみません。ベビーカーはどこですか。",
  "voice": "Autonoe",
  "model": "gemini-3.8-flash-lite-tts"
 },
 "s2-02": {
  "file": "s2-02.mp3",
  "hash": "ee5ae5fdceadad97",
  "text": "ベビーカーですか。大きいお荷物は、あちらのカウンターです。",
  "voice": "Kore",
  "model": "gemini-3.8-flash-lite-tts"
 },
 "s2-03": {
  "file": "s2-03.mp3",
  "hash": "70b9a0fb9ecda7eb",
  "text": "すみません、もう少しゆっくりお願いします。",
  "voice": "Autonoe",
  "model": "gemini-3.8-flash-lite-tts"
 },
 "s2-04": {
  "file": "s2-04.mp3",
  "hash": "111371bd88bd75e5",
  "text": "はい。ベビーカーは、あちらの、青いカウンターです。",
  "voice": "Kore",
  "model": "gemini-3.8-flash-lite-tts"
 },
 "s2-05": {
  "file": "s2-05.mp3",
  "hash": "97066e12b923d61c",
  "text": "あった！ママ、ベビーカー、あった！",
  "voice": "Laomedeia",
  "model": "gemini-3.8-flash-lite-tts"
 },
 "s3-02": {
  "file": "s3-02.mp3",
  "hash": "f6206abf39dcd2e9",
  "text": "エレベーターは、あちらです。トイレの横です。",
  "voice": "Charon",
  "model": "gemini-3.8-flash-lite-tts"
 },
 "s3-01": {
  "file": "s3-01.mp3",
  "hash": "6891bef2a7a3a547",
  "text": "すみません。エレベーターはどこですか。父は膝が悪いので……。",
  "voice": "Autonoe",
  "model": "gemini-3.8-flash-lite-tts"
 },
 "s3-03": {
  "file": "s3-03.mp3",
  "hash": "33acbbc078fcf511",
  "text": "ママ、トイレはどこ？アーバオが、おしっこ！",
  "voice": "Laomedeia",
  "model": "gemini-3.8-flash-lite-tts"
 },
 "s3-04": {
  "file": "s3-04.mp3",
  "hash": "a77213c64e769417",
  "text": "エレベーターの横ですよ。行きましょう。",
  "voice": "Autonoe",
  "model": "gemini-3.8-flash-lite-tts"
 },
 "s3-05": {
  "file": "s3-05.mp3",
  "hash": "0f217366ba88108c",
  "text": "ありがとうございます！",
  "voice": "Laomedeia",
  "model": "gemini-3.8-flash-lite-tts"
 },
 "s3-06": {
  "file": "s3-06.mp3",
  "hash": "a9e6658257ec9481",
  "text": "わあ、にほんご、上手ですね。",
  "voice": "Charon",
  "model": "gemini-3.8-flash-lite-tts"
 },
 "s3-07": {
  "file": "s3-07.mp3",
  "hash": "4a4f38acaca18225",
  "text": "次は電車ですね……。がんばります。",
  "voice": "Autonoe",
  "model": "gemini-3.8-flash-lite-tts"
 },
 "g1-ex1": {
  "file": "g1-ex1.mp3",
  "hash": "951a8393f240bd33",
  "text": "「これはお子様の靴ですか。」「はい、そうです。」",
  "voice": "Sulafat",
  "model": "gemini-3.8-flash-lite-tts"
 },
 "g1-ex2": {
  "file": "g1-ex2.mp3",
  "hash": "8e30e5ef7ee1d5f0",
  "text": "「お二人ですか。」「いいえ、三人です。」",
  "voice": "Sulafat",
  "model": "gemini-3.8-flash-lite-tts"
 },
 "g2-ex1": {
  "file": "g2-ex1.mp3",
  "hash": "728f93543e48b506",
  "text": "すみません、授乳室はどこですか。",
  "voice": "Sulafat",
  "model": "gemini-3.8-flash-lite-tts"
 },
 "g2-ex2": {
  "file": "g2-ex2.mp3",
  "hash": "35535234f751eb46",
  "text": "おむつ交換台はどこですか。",
  "voice": "Sulafat",
  "model": "gemini-3.8-flash-lite-tts"
 },
